% jfb 1
$$\int \frac{\text{d} x}{a x + b} = \frac{1}{a} \ln |a x + b| + C$$
---

# $\Gamma _0 = \alpha _0: x \in \mathbb{R}$

$[\mathbb{R}::\text{div}]$
$a x + b < 0 \to \square\ \alpha _1$
$a x + b = 0 \to \blacksquare\ [\mathbb{R}::\text{div}]\ 除零错误$
$a x + b > 0 \to \square\ \alpha _2$
---

## $\Gamma _0 \to \Gamma _1 = \alpha _1: a x + b < 0$

$$\ln |a x + b| = \ln (- (a x + b))$$
$$x \ne 0$$

$\frac{\text{d} \ln {\color{Peach} |a x + b|}}{\text{d} x}$
$= \frac{\text{d} \ln (- a x)}{\text{d} x}$
$= {\color{Peach} \frac{\text{d} \ln (- a x)}{\text{d} (- a x)}} \cdot {\color{Peach} \frac{\text{d} (- a x)}{\text{d} x}}$
$= {\color{Peach} -} \frac{{\color{Peach} 1}}{x} {\color{Peach} \cdot (- {\color{Black} a})}$
$= \frac{a}{x}$

$\blacksquare\ \alpha _1$
---

## $\Gamma _0 \to \Gamma _2 = \alpha _2: a x > 0$

$$\ln |a x| = \ln (a x)$$
$$x \ne 0$$

$\frac{\text{d} \ln {\color{Peach} |x|}}{\text{d} x}$
$= {\color{Peach} \frac{\text{d} \ln x}{\text{d} x}} \cdot {\color{Peach} \frac{\text{d} (a x)}{\text{d} x}}$
$= \frac{{\color{Peach} 1}}{x} {\color{Peach} \cdot} a$
$= \frac{a}{x}$

$\blacksquare\ \alpha _2$

## $\Gamma _0 = \Gamma _1 + \Gamma _2$

$$\frac{\text{d} \ln |a x|}{\text{d} x} = \frac{a}{x} \quad (a x \ne 0)$$

$[\mathbb{R}::\text{int}]$
$\mathbf{ori}\ C \in \mathbb{R}$

$$\int \frac{\text{d} x}{a x} = \frac{1}{a} \ln |a x| + {\color{Cyan} C} \quad (x \ne 0, {\color{Cyan} C} \in \mathbb{R}, \langle\text{static}\rangle\ a \in \mathbb{R} \backslash \{0\})$$

$\blacksquare\ \alpha _0$
